  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (C): Under IRC Section 1362(b), an S election must be filed by the 15th day of the 3rd month (March 15 for calendar-year corporations) to be effective for the current year. Crestview filed April 20, after the deadline, so the election is effective January 1, 2027.
Wrong (A): The late filing disqualifies current-year effectiveness. A January 1, 2026 effective date would require filing by March 15, 2026.
Wrong (B): The election does not take effect on the filing date. It becomes effective at the start of the next tax year when filed late.
