Wrong (B): This ignores the fourth-tier excess business loss limitation under Section 461(l), which applies even when basis and at-risk amounts are sufficient.
Wrong (C): The $195,000 excess is not permanently disallowed. It converts to an NOL carryforward under Section 172, available in future years.
