Wrong (A): The employee fringe benefit exclusion under Section 79 does not apply to more-than-2% S corporation shareholders, who are treated as self-employed for these purposes.
Wrong (B): The premiums are both deductible by the corporation and reportable on Dawson''s W-2. Omitting W-2 reporting would understate Dawson''s taxable income.
