  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (A): Under IRC Section 305(a), a pro rata distribution of common stock on common stock is generally nontaxable. Because no corporate assets leave the corporation, E&P is not reduced. The same earnings are simply divided among more shares.
Wrong (B): E&P is reduced only when the corporation distributes property or cash that depletes corporate assets. Issuing additional shares does not deplete assets.
Wrong (C): Par value has no relevance to the E&P computation for nontaxable stock dividends. No reduction occurs regardless of par value.
